msgstr "这将使用 'rpm --rebuilddb' 重建 RPM 数据库。继续吗？"

#: MainWindow.cpp:380
msgid "Repairing RPM database..."
msgstr "正在修复 RPM 数据库..."

#: MainWindow.cpp:385
msgid ""
"This will remove unnecessary packages via 'dnf autoremove -y'. Continue?"
msgstr "这将通过 'dnf autoremove -y' 移除不必要的软件包。继续吗？"

#: MainWindow.cpp:391
msgid "Cleaning unused packages..."
msgstr "正在清理未使用的软件包..."

#: MainWindow.cpp:396
msgid ""
